  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Its attack range is smaller than fire pellets. Bai Ning Bing already knows it can move only several meters from Yan Tu. Under skilled control it is quick and stable and keeps grabbing. When it falls on grassland it sets that patch on fire. Yan Tu can raise it again from the flames in a weaker state, then restore it by spending primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing’s frost arrow Gu suppresses its flames. Ice explosion Gu with icicles then extinguishes the claw completely, and Yan Tu recovers the Gu rather than lose it.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_frost_arrow_gu",
          "gu_ice_explosion_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He holds four fiery claw Gu and sends all four out. They merge into the two snakes from Fiery Snake Gu, which grow claws and become fiery dragons that display a portion of the might of rank five fiery dragon Gu. Audiences name that killer move fire sea twin dragon kill. The dragons tear at Bai Ning Bing’s ice blade storm with those claws, retreat into the sea of fire to recover, and later merge into one larger dragon whose four claws strike together. Bai Ning Bing freezes the claws with Frost Breath Gu, then her storm engulfs most of the dragon. Yan Tu loses two fiery claw Gu in that exchange, along with a fiery snake Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "combined-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_fiery_snake_gu",
          "gu_frost_breath_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
